'''Traffic Safety Week''' (交通安全週間, ''Kōtsū Anzen Shūkan'', '''Traffic Safety Week''') is a 2-slot [[Cat Combo]]. It was added in [[Version 15.5 Update|Version 15.5]] and is unlocked after completing [[Into the Future]] Chapter 3.

==Effect==
"Slow" Effects Up (M): Slow duration increases by 20%.

